<title>NETHERLANDS: BEERS TO TAKE OVER ALEX VAN KEULEN.</title>
<headline>BEERS TO TAKE OVER ALEX VAN KEULEN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beers NV said it had signed an agreement to take over Scania truck dealer Alex van Keulen BV as of December 31, 1996.  </p>
<p>Beers said Alex van Keulen accounted for 11 percent of total sales of Scania trucks in the Netherlands.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
